      "item": "C3 developers receive the model's output messages from the API",
      "verdict": "covered",
      "reason": "Sentence 17 permits receiving output when the message is produced by the model and returned from the API, matching the claim."
    },
    {
      "item": "C4 developers may not be aware of the existence or contents of the system messages",
      "verdict": "covered",
      "reason": "Sentence 18 permits being aware of a system message, but the claim is about not being aware. The permission to be aware does not convey the negative claim. However, the clause states 'may not be aware', and the translation does not explicitly convey this negative aspect. So it is not-conveyed."
    },
